"/farmland-atlas/kansas/kearny-county"],["ARC or PLC in Kearny County","/arc-plc/kansas/kearny-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record for Kearny County runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids, January to February and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 42 years, and July to August did it in 29. In 2026 so far, February to March came in at 7% of normal and March to April at 9% on the middle of the grids. Every grid shown had its driest year in 1956, with grid 21115 at 36% of normal that year.</p>"}
